{"hw":"θόλος","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">θόλος</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">θόλος</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">round building with conical roof, rotunda</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">22.442</span> </span>, al., cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hsch.</span> </span> </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> at Athens, <b class=\"lex-tr\">the Rotunda</b>, in which the Prytaneis, etc., dined, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">32c</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">And.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.45</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">19.249</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ath.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">43.3</span> </span>, Alexand. Com.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Paus.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.5.1</span> </span>; a similar building at Epidaurus, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.27.3</span> </span>; at Magnesia on Maeander, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">SIG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">589.43</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(ii B.C.)</span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <span class=\"gk\">θόλος, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ὁ</span> </span>, in public baths, <b class=\"lex-tr\">vaul